msgctxt "a_seedphrase_lets_you_recover_your_account"
msgid "A seedphrase lets you recover your account if you lose access."
msgstr "Med en seedfras kan du återställa ditt konto om du förlorar åtkomsten."

msgctxt "a_seedphrase_lets_you_recover_your_account_2"
msgid "A seedphrase lets you recover your account if you lose access. Store it safely."
msgstr "Med en seedfras kan du återställa ditt konto om du förlorar åtkomsten. Förvara den säkert."

#. Settings: heading of the about section.
msgctxt "about"
msgid "About"
msgstr "Om"

#. Instructions for accessing the authentication code.
#. Use the {link}...{/link} markers to wrap the "ur.io" portion, which should be rendered as a clickable link.
#. Example usage:
#.   - Web: Replace {link} with <a href="https://ur.io" target="_blank"> and {/link} with </a>
#.   - SwiftUI: Use AttributedString parsing to detect {link}...{/link} and apply .link attribute to the range
#.   - Jetpack Compose: Use AnnotatedString with an annotation for the {link}...{/link} range, and handle clicks accordingly
#. 
msgctxt "access_auth_code_instructions"
msgid "To Access your Auth Code, create an account and sign in to {link}ur.io{/link}. Head over to Account -> Settings -> Create/Copy Auth code -> Paste -> UR In!"
msgstr "För att komma åt din autentiseringskod, skapa ett konto och logga in på {link}ur.io{/link}. Gå till Konto -> Inställningar -> Skapa/Kopiera autentiseringskod -> Klistra in -> Klart!"

